; The engine's measurements that no lane owns: probes that settle a representation decision.
;   bench_array  slice 3.1 of the OCaml estate refactor (decision D-3): four spellings of a
;                Lean `Array` against the list shim the LCNF route uses today, each answer
;                checked against the shim's.
;   bench_frame  phase 5: three ways to write a nested frame of the canonical wire, checked
;                against Eff_val.to_bytes, and the real writer (Eff_val, Eff_wire) on values
;                and programs, so one source measures before and after a change.
; Executables, not tests: a bench is a measurement, not a gate, so `dune test` runs neither.

(executables
 (names bench_array bench_frame)
 (modules bench_array bench_frame)
 (libraries unix effect4_eff))
